@startuml state_segment
title RoadSegment state machine (Impassable is a per-vehicle query, not a state)
[*] --> Dry
Dry --> Wet : rain > r0 or h > 1 cm
Dry --> Rising : h > 5 cm
Wet --> Rising : h > 5 cm
Wet --> Dry : no rain and h < 1 cm for 30 min
Rising --> Receding : dh/dt < 0 sustained
Receding --> Rising : rain resumes / dh/dt > 0 sustained
Receding --> Wet : h < 5 cm
Dry --> Unknown : no observation > 20 min
Wet --> Unknown : no observation > 20 min
Rising --> Unknown : no observation > 20 min
Receding --> Unknown : no observation > 20 min
Unknown --> Wet : new obs, h < 5 cm
Unknown --> Receding : new obs, falling
Unknown --> Rising : new obs, otherwise
note right of Unknown
  Fail-safe: blocks vehicles with
  safe depth < 30 cm
end note
note right of Rising
  re-forecast every 2 min
end note
@enduml
